a well dressed man is sitting on a rock, next to the village’s entrance, looking downcast; he is eyeing you… quietly judging….
- you ignore him
	noble: hold on traveler, if a knight like you happens to come to our village, he must his reasons to, mind sharing your travel with this humble disgraced noble?
